 "facts": {
  "f1": {
   "text": "원본 11.56~12.56 'Oh, no.'(스피치매틱스 enhanced 영어) — 창업자 둘이 맨발로 레고가 흩어진 바닥을 걸어 들어오자 금발 투자자 반응(화면 11.58~12.78)",
   "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X25MIpQqLIU",
   "kind": "방송 원음"
  },
  "f2": {
   "text": "원본 25.16~41.72 'Pick Up Bricks… We're here to talk about pain… The dreaded walk of pain. The most painful experience a parent can face.' · 화면 5~11·35~44 맨발·레고 카펫",
   "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X25MIpQqLIU",
   "kind": "방송 원음+화면"
  },
  "f3": {
   "text": "원본 54.60~66.60 'The pain of getting your kids to just pick up their stuff… that's why I created Pick Up Bricks, the kid's toy vacuum that picks up bricks and other little toys.' · 73.72~79.40 'We made Pick Up Bricks cordless, durable, easy to use. It's perfect for kids.'",
   "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X25MIpQqLIU",
   "kind": "방송 원음"
  },
  "f4": {
   "text": "원본 79.52~87.00 'But unlike a normal vacuum, our patented design separates the dirt and dust from the toys, leaving you with cleaner toys and a cleaner floor.'",
   "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X25MIpQqLIU",
   "kind": "방송 원음"
  },
  "f5": {
   "text": "원본 110.48~115.20 'You'll each find your very own Pick Up Bricks and a pile of toys to suck up.' · 120.36 'Wow, this thing is serious.' · 129.20 'You don't have to clean them all up.' · 138.16~141.08 'Just picking up the bricks is fun. / Yes, exactly.' · 화면 115~142 투자자 다섯이 직접 써 봄",
   "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X25MIpQqLIU",
   "kind": "방송 원음+화면"
  },
  "f6": {
   "text": "원본 415.85~418.17 'Listen, you've got four offers.' · 440.33~443.05 'I am going to go to 15%.' · 화면 328~332·407~410 제안하는 투자자",
   "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X25MIpQqLIU",
   "kind": "방송 원음"
  },
  "f7": {
   "text": "원본 502.81~504.41 'But you're getting two sharks.' · 518.81~521.41 'Is there any chance you guys would do it for 16 split?' · 529.25 'Sure.' · 532.25 'All right.' · 533.81~534.57 'We got a deal.' · 화면 537~541 포옹",
   "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X25MIpQqLIU",
